## Rocky VM mcctrl prepare_binprm Compatibility Fix

Observed:
- After the Rocky 8.10 `handle_mm_fault()` fix, the `mcctrl_ko` build moved
  forward and failed in `executer/kernel/mcctrl/binfmt_mcexec.c`.
