- `kernel/rust/tests/run_equivalence.sh` passed.
- `cmake --build /tmp/mckernel-rocky-rust --target mckernel.img -j2` passed.
- Installed the rebuilt image under `/opt/mckernel-rust`.
- Re-ran the preserved V10 command with full log capture at
  `/tmp/mckernel-v10-20260517-181523.log`:
  `scripts/rocky-rust-validation.sh --skip-deps --skip-rust --boot-smoke --trace-smoke --yes --jobs 2`
- The V10 run configured, built, installed, booted, passed `mcexec /bin/true`,
